Subject: [PATCH] feat(browser): page translation with provider abstraction

- TranslationProvider contract with credential gating; no fake keys
- First provider: free Google translate web endpoint (fa-first)
- Registry with preference order; browser menu entry translates the
  current page in a normal tab
